world  cup

floor
  friction  0.8, rolling 0.002
  size      6 m

ramp
  high end  1 m up
  low end   1.6 m along, 0.45 m up
  width     40 cm

ball
  is a      sphere 6 cm, 200 g
  is        rolls, dead
  friction  0.8, spinning 0.01, rolling 0.004
  rests     on ramp, 12 cm from the top

cup
  is an   open box 90 by 60 cm, walls 30 cm
  stands  on floor, 2.05 m along

expect
  ball touches ramp
  ball comes to rest in cup
